ILANG
[TYPE:config][PROJECT:vps-deals][LANG:en-US]


::STATE{@SITE, brand:vps-deals, niche:VPS hosting offers, domain:https://vps-deals-eny.pages.dev, locale:en-US, scrape_interval:6h}


::MODULE{PROVIDERS|title:Public official VPS offer sources}
# name | home_url | source_url | affiliate_url (blank means official link)
Hostinger | https://www.hostinger.com/ | https://www.hostinger.com/vps-hosting |
IONOS CONFIG TEST | https://www.ionos.com/ | https://www.ionos.com/servers/cheap-vps |
Contabo | https://contabo.com/en-us/ | https://contabo.com/en-us/pricing/ |
Hetzner | https://www.hetzner.com/ | https://www.hetzner.com/cloud/cost-optimized/ |
::END


::MODULE{FIELDS|title:Offer fields}
title price currency offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at provider
::END


::RULE{price_missing⇒omit price and do not publish an Offer}
::RULE{valid_until_expired⇒mark expired or remove from active offers}
::BOUNDARY{never:invent offers, prices, commissions, expiry dates|scope:permanent}
